\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q1. What is React?}{\loch
\line A JavaScript library used to build interactive and reusable user interfaces.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q2. What is a component?}{\loch
\line A reusable building block of a React UI.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q3. What is JSX?}{\loch
\line A syntax that allows us to describe UI using HTML-like syntax inside JavaScript.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q4. What is state?}{\loch
\line Changeable data managed by a React component.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q5. What is }{\loch\cs16\rtlch\af5 \ltrch\hich\af5\loch\f5\dbch\af9\loch
useState()}{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
?}{\loch
\line A React Hook used to create and manage state.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q6. What are props?}{\loch
\line Data passed from a parent component to a child component.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q7. Props vs state?}{\loch
\line Props are passed into a component, while state is managed by the component and can change.}
\par \pard\plain \s19\loch\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch\cs15\rtlch\ab \ltrch\loch\b\loch
Q8. How does PowerWatch update its dashboard?}{\loch
\line When equipment temperature changes, its status is recalculated. The status is sent to the parent component, which updates the shared state and automatically updates the summary dashboard.}
